{
  "name": "@dshop/admin",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "DShop 运营/商户后台：Vite + React 19 + Ant Design 5 SPA，平台后台与商户后台按 hostname 分流（docs/03 §3.5.2）。含 PiEcho 两个运营入口：Agent 令牌管理、售后政策发布。",
